om/review/show/6873253133"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.acwwFI-pxrLPHBEnHcS3sQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.acwwFI-pxrLPHBEnHcS3sQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:40774701"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1727187291042,"createdAt":1664901584360,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1666697755541,"text":"I love Cinderella retellings in any shape or form, there is something magical about meeting your prince at a ball. :) \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was very much looking forward to the story and liked the synopsis, but it kind of fell flat for me.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDr Zanai James is only focused on her work. After a stunning makeover, she finds herself and a masquerade dance and even kisses Jayden Lattimore.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShe was hidden by her mask, but Jayden tracked her down quite fast. She doesn't have the best home life, so trusting that someone actually wants her, it's not an easy thing. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd with everyone meddling, it takes a while for trust to build and for them to find their HEA.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ethanks to Harlequin Desire and Netgalley for the ARC, all thoughts are my own","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3G6ED5Z0AUBLN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:32084577":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":32084577,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1402203855i/32084577._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":356,"name":"Cheryl Jamai","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/32084577-cheryl-jamai","contributor":null,"id":32084577},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1ORMHOTXWVNLJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ORMHOTXWVNLJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ORMHOTXWVNLJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1ORMHOTXWVNLJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1ORMHOTXWVNLJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/32084577?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5069404706"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-ROAlxnAIxbxyPpXLIGyiQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.-ROAlxnAIxbxyPpXLIGyiQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:32084577"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1666847638388,"createdAt":1666847638206,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1666847638206,"text":"Jayden Lattimore doesn’t recognize Dr. Zanai James at the towns Masquerade ball, but her beauty catches his eye. A flirty conversation, sealed with a kiss, leaves Jayden wanting more. It’s like real life Cinderella when Zanai leaves something behind. Being hidden at the masquerade ball is one thing, but interacting in a closer way allows them to truly see each other. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is more to Jayden than meets the eye. He is about having fun, but he knows one date is not enough. Jayden’s romantic and caring spirit surprised me. He brings out the inner Queen that attracted him to Zanai. I don’t like how Zanai looks down on herself and thinks she isn’t good enough. The most eligible bachelor is interested in her for a reason! He thinks she is gorgeous and has an inner appeal. She is at the top of her game professionally and her inner confidence and passion comes out in how she makes 