ania James is convinced to go to a masquerade ball by her friend Morgan. She catches the attention of Jayden Lattimore. He enjoys talking to her at the dance. Zania disappears before Jayden can get her name. He goes on a mission to find her. He is determined to get to know her. Even though he has been around her 15 years, prior to the dance he never really noticed her. Zania is normally very quiet and reserved but she has another side. She is also very funny, a great conversationalist and a kind and compassionate person. The one bad thing is how poorly Zania is treated by her father. I wanted to knee cap. He constantly belittles her. Because of her friend Morgan and Jayden's kindness Zania realizes she realizes her true self. I really enjoyed reading this story.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3D3XBKVYF09OO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:107265449":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":107265449,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1656904749i/107265449._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":10,"textReviewsCount":712,"name":"Breeana","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/107265449-breeana","contributor":null,"id":107265449},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2U00DG3U5G4FV":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2U00DG3U5G4FV"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2U00DG3U5G4FV\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2U00DG3U5G4FV","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2U00DG3U5G4FV"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.lNz87B91uCwlMJXM"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","di