://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6873253480"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2022102719.09fdd508-aeb5-43e8-9532-ef9299fedef9":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2022102719.09fdd508-aeb5-43e8-9532-ef9299fedef9","creator":{"__ref":"User:32020643"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1727187296291,"createdAt":1666897260814,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1666897321023,"text":"This is the seventh book involving Ranchers and Rivals and is a great read\u003cbr /\u003eWith a quiet, reticent Dr Zanai James taking the lead.\u003cbr /\u003eWith her father and step mother both denigrating her always\u003cbr /\u003eShe prefers keeping quiet and rarely strays.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever her best friend has other ideas and so\u003cbr /\u003eTo the Masquerade it is that Zanai is to go.\u003cbr /\u003eWhilst there she catches the eye of Jayden Lattimore\u003cbr /\u003eThey've met a plenty but never spoken much before.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWith sizzling chemistry, their attraction is there from the start\u003cbr /\u003eBut Zanai doesn't trust him not to break her heart\u003cbr /\u003eShe's grown up feeling worthless and cannot believe it is true\u003cbr /\u003eThat someone can really see her and grow to love her, too.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat a heartwarming romance this proved to be\u003cbr /\u003eWith family drama and an added mystery.\u003cbr /\u003eCan love find a way to help bring them together\u003cbr /\u003eOr will her father split them up forever?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA great story to enjoy and escape into\u003cbr /\u003eSo I have no hesitation in recommending it to you! \u003cbr /\u003eFor my complementary copy of this book, I say thank you,\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed reading it and this is my honest review.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3QJ5798W4O5IK\"},\"book\":{\"id\":