eeded this week. With the brainy doctor whose friend dresses her up for a masquerade ball where one of the Lattimore's takes notice. He can't stop thinking about her after she drops an earring and when he realizes that his Queen is unassuming Zanai he wants to spend time with her. She isn't the debutante her family and their set want her to be, she's a therapist for neurodivergent youth in the low income area of her community. And omg it's like she's a social pariah. Instead of being proud of her they are disgusted by that. Ugh some people are just trash.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLove how she removes the toxicity from her life once she realizes that she can survive without it. Also, we can all survive without those toxic people in our lives. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you harlequinbooks and netgalley for the e-aRC for my honest and voluntary review.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AMKQ0B18XQVET\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:33931413":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":33931413,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1665494170i/33931413._UX200_CR0,47,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":6,"textReviewsCount":128,"name":"Kellie Corinne","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/33931413-kellie-corinne","contributor":null,"id":33931413},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33931413?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6873253599"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.abtgwfHRIhoHJXP4jS28nA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.abtgwfHRIhoHJXP4jS28nA","creator":{"__ref":"User:33931413"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1727187296986,"createdAt":1667265184853,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1667317552130,"text":"224 pages, ebook\u003cbr /\u003ePublished October 25, 2022\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you to #netgalley and #harlequin for the advanced reader's copy of #cinderellamasquerade by #laquette. This is a remixed version of the classic Cinderella story. This is book 7 of the Texas Cattleman's Club.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDr. Zanai James feels like a fish out of water at the Texas Rancher's masquerade ball. There she chats with handsome rancher Jayden Lattimore and they share an electrifying kiss. Jayden does not recognize her in her mask so he begins to track down his Cinderella.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall this was a cute romance novel. The Cinderella trope regarding Zanai's family was cringe. The main characters were a bit lackluster for me. I found Zanai to be self-depreciating and Jayden arrogant. The spice was hot which I always appreciate. I rate this romance 3 stars. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31NG28QTFF7RJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.LJ7JQAmqq5v1QGCI\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:51414936":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":51414936,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":fa